Crowd funding as a Funding Option:
An entrepreneur will put up a detailed description of his business on
a crowdfunding platform. He will mention the goals of his business,
plans for making a profit, how much funding he needs and for what
reasons, etc. and then investors can read about the business and give
money if they like the idea. Those giving money will make online
pledges with the promise of pre-buying the product or giving a
donation. Anyone can contribute money toward helping a business
that they really believe in.
